OL,3,GNEWSAPlayground staff say they are
OL,4,Afighting 'tooth and nail' to stay open
OL,5,
OL,6,FWatching on his dad, Bledar, says
OL,7,F"there should be more places like this"
OL,8,Ffor children, as Benny runs back to
OL,9,Ftell him he has just jumped off "the
OL,10,Fhighest level".
